{
  "an4.99:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.99 ",
  "an4.99:0.2": "10. Asuravagga ",
  "an4.99:0.3": "Sikkhāpadasutta ",
  "an4.99:1.1": "“Cattārome, bhikkhave, puggalā santo saṁvijjamānā lokasmiṁ. ",
  "an4.99:1.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.99:1.3": "attahitāya paṭipanno no parahitāya, ",
  "an4.99:1.4": "parahitāya paṭipanno no attahitāya, ",
  "an4.99:1.5": "nevattahitāya paṭipanno no parahitāya, ",
  "an4.99:1.6": "attahitāya ceva paṭipanno parahitāya ca. ",
  "an4.99:2.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, puggalo attahitāya paṭipanno hoti, no parahitāya? ",
  "an4.99:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo attanā pāṇātipātā paṭivirato hoti, no paraṁ pāṇātipātā veramaṇiyā samādapeti; ",
  "an4.99:2.3": "attanā adinnādānā paṭivirato hoti, no paraṁ adinnādānā veramaṇiyā samādapeti; ",
  "an4.99:2.4": "attanā kāmesumicchācārā paṭivirato hoti, no paraṁ kāmesumicchācārā veramaṇiyā samādapeti; ",
  "an4.99:2.5": "attanā musāvādā paṭivirato hoti, no paraṁ musāvādā veramaṇiyā samādapeti; ",
  "an4.99:2.6": "attanā surāmerayamajjapamādaṭṭhānā paṭivirato hoti, no paraṁ surāmerayamajjapamādaṭṭhānā veramaṇiyā samādapeti. ",
  "an4.99:2.7": "Evaṁ kho, bhikkhave, puggalo attahitāya paṭipanno hoti, no parahitāya. ",
  "an4.99:3.1": "Kathañca, bhikkhave, puggalo parahitāya paṭipanno hoti, no attahitāya? ",
  "an4.99:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo attanā pāṇātipātā appaṭivirato hoti, p